    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hypermarket Simulator</strong>\u00a0is a cozy and immersive retail simulation game where you build, manage, and grow a massive shopping paradise that goes way beyond groceries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/68c107e8496e85fa0717962865fcc4db.poster.avif?t=1755676370\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/68c107e8496e85fa0717962865fcc4db.webm?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/68c107e8496e85fa0717962865fcc4db.mp4?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the Ultimate One-Stop Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From electronics to sportswear, frozen food to home d\u00e9cor\u2014design your dream hypermarket filled with everything under one roof. Customize the layout, choose your departments, and create a shopping experience your customers will love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/115cddc051493cb7ab734fd407d138c3.poster.avif?t=1755676370\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/115cddc051493cb7ab734fd407d138c3.webm?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/115cddc051493cb7ab734fd407d138c3.mp4?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Inventory and Realism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock thousands of different products\u2014but be smart! Frozen goods need to be stored properly or they'll go rancid and become unsellable. Organize your backroom storage, build custom stock areas, and manage your supply like a pro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/bb4cfebb7bebad84e7127361ef6ec744.poster.avif?t=1755676370\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/bb4cfebb7bebad84e7127361ef6ec744.webm?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/bb4cfebb7bebad84e7127361ef6ec744.mp4?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embrace Automation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your hypermarket expands, so does the chaos. To keep things running smoothly, you can streamline operations by installing self-checkout kiosks and hiring staff to assist customers and restock shelves. Invest wisely to strike the perfect balance between speed, efficiency, and service quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/1b93848d469429057f77576a88c531df.poster.avif?t=1755676370\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/1b93848d469429057f77576a88c531df.webm?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/1b93848d469429057f77576a88c531df.mp4?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stock, Sell, and Strategize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-pick what you sell, set prices, and track what\u2019s flying off the shelves. Will you specialize in high-end electronics or become the go-to spot for home essentials? Your pricing strategy, shelf organization, and restocking speed will make or break your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/4f167c28faa8aef02d2f07fbe965a130.poster.avif?t=1755676370\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/4f167c28faa8aef02d2f07fbe965a130.webm?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/4f167c28faa8aef02d2f07fbe965a130.mp4?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand and Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small, dream big. Use your profits to expand your floor space and unlock new product categories to keep your operation running smoothly. Turn your hypermarket into a retail empire with smart upgrades and customer-focused planning.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hypermarket Simulator</strong>\u00a0is a cozy and immersive retail simulation game where you build, manage, and grow a massive shopping paradise that goes way beyond groceries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/68c107e8496e85fa0717962865fcc4db.poster.avif?t=1755676370\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/68c107e8496e85fa0717962865fcc4db.webm?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/68c107e8496e85fa0717962865fcc4db.mp4?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the Ultimate One-Stop Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From electronics to sportswear, frozen food to home d\u00e9cor\u2014design your dream hypermarket filled with everything under one roof. Customize the layout, choose your departments, and create a shopping experience your customers will love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/115cddc051493cb7ab734fd407d138c3.poster.avif?t=1755676370\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/115cddc051493cb7ab734fd407d138c3.webm?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/115cddc051493cb7ab734fd407d138c3.mp4?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Inventory and Realism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock thousands of different products\u2014but be smart! Frozen goods need to be stored properly or they'll go rancid and become unsellable. Organize your backroom storage, build custom stock areas, and manage your supply like a pro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/bb4cfebb7bebad84e7127361ef6ec744.poster.avif?t=1755676370\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/bb4cfebb7bebad84e7127361ef6ec744.webm?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/bb4cfebb7bebad84e7127361ef6ec744.mp4?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embrace Automation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your hypermarket expands, so does the chaos. To keep things running smoothly, you can streamline operations by installing self-checkout kiosks and hiring staff to assist customers and restock shelves. Invest wisely to strike the perfect balance between speed, efficiency, and service quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/1b93848d469429057f77576a88c531df.poster.avif?t=1755676370\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/1b93848d469429057f77576a88c531df.webm?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/1b93848d469429057f77576a88c531df.mp4?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stock, Sell, and Strategize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-pick what you sell, set prices, and track what\u2019s flying off the shelves. Will you specialize in high-end electronics or become the go-to spot for home essentials? Your pricing strategy, shelf organization, and restocking speed will make or break your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/4f167c28faa8aef02d2f07fbe965a130.poster.avif?t=1755676370\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/4f167c28faa8aef02d2f07fbe965a130.webm?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/4f167c28faa8aef02d2f07fbe965a130.mp4?t=1755676370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand and Evolve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small, dream big. Use your profits to expand your floor space and unlock new product categories to keep your operation running smoothly. Turn your hypermarket into a retail empire with smart upgrades and customer-focused planning.</p>",
